{"t":"Dream Scar","s":"dream-scar-f70b1","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Plagueroot_beb666.gif","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox2 pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Dream Scar</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">12.00.7695<br/>December 03, 2018<br/>Winter Update 2018</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: <a href=\"#/quest/the-dream-courts-quest\">The Dream Courts Quest</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Dream Scar</b>, also referred to as the <b>Dream Arena</b> or simply the <b>Arena</b>, is a fighting pit accessible through the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dream%20Labyrinth\">Dream Labyrinth</a>.  \nIt was created as a containment chamber to imprison <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Nightmare%20Beast\">The Nightmare Beast</a> and prevent its release into the world.\n</p><p>Each day, a different Champion takes the stage in the Arena.  \nThe boss changes with every <a href=\"#/wiki/Server%20Save\">Server Save</a>, including during emergency ones, meaning that the current boss can vary between game worlds.  \nThis occurs because certain worlds occasionally experience additional, unscheduled Server Saves.\n</p><p>You can see the Boss of the Day for all servers here.\n</p><p>There are five main bosses, with <a href=\"#/wiki/Izcandar%20the%20Banished\">Izcandar the Banished</a> having three possible variants depending on where he is defeated within the Arena, resulting in a total of seven possible encounters:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Plagueroot\"><img alt=\"Plagueroot\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Plagueroot_beb666.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Plagueroot\">Plagueroot</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Malofur%20Mangrinder\"><img alt=\"Malofur Mangrinder\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Malofur_Mangrinder_02b72f.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Malofur%20Mangrinder\">Malofur Mangrinder</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Maxxenius\"><img alt=\"Maxxenius\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Maxxenius_a66fe7.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Maxxenius\">Maxxenius</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Alptramun\"><img alt=\"Alptramun\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Alptramun_042051.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Alptramun\">Alptramun</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Izcandar%20the%20Banished\"><img alt=\"Izcandar the Banished\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Izcandar_the_Banished_fa3850.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Izcandar%20the%20Banished\">Izcandar the Banished</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Izcandar%20Champion%20of%20Winter\"><img alt=\"Izcandar Champion of Winter\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Izcandar_Champion_of_Winter_1b2889.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Izcandar%20Champion%20of%20Winter\">Izcandar Champion of Winter</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Izcandar%20Champion%20of%20Summer\"><img alt=\"Izcandar Champion of Summer\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Izcandar_Champion_of_Summer_b2f6bc.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Izcandar%20Champion%20of%20Summer\">Izcandar Champion of Summer</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<p>When fighting <a href=\"#/wiki/Izcandar%20the%20Banished\">Izcandar the Banished</a>, the variant you face depends on the location within the Arena where he is slain:\n</p>\n<ul><li>If he dies in the <i>eastern area - summer side</i>, he transforms into <a href=\"#/wiki/Izcandar%20Champion%20of%20Summer\">Izcandar Champion of Summer</a>.</li>\n<li>If he dies in the <i>western area - winter side</i>, he transforms into <a href=\"#/wiki/Izcandar%20Champion%20of%20Winter\">Izcandar Champion of Winter</a>.</li>\n<li>If he dies near the <i>center</i>, he remains <i>neutral</i> as <a href=\"#/wiki/Izcandar%20the%20Banished\">Izcandar the Banished</a>.</li></ul></div>","quests":["dream-warrior-outfits-quest","the-dream-courts-quest"]}